Yeah, I don't want to clutter up diskspace with all the messages from all
my games, because I am normally only interested in the latest ones.
I made the buffer size easy to configure in case somebody wants to have
more of them than what I do. Of course, it would have been even easier to
configure with a runtime option instead of a compile time one, but I was
lazy.. 

